window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A sarcastic psychic. A partner she can’t read. A mystery that refuses to stay buried.</p> <p>Diana Hawthorne sees more than most people—except when it comes to her own past. With snark to spare and an eye-roll always at the ready, she helps clients navigate everything from cheating boyfriends to dearly departed grandmas. But when a missing person case lands on her doorstep—and the broody, too-good-looking Blake strolls into her life—things get weird.</p> <p>And not in the fun, “let’s light some sage and manifest good vibes” kind of way.</p> <p>For the first time ever, Diana’s gifts fall short. Blake’s a total psychic blind spot, and the case they’re tangled in? It reeks of something bigger…something ancient.</p> <p>Now Diana must piece together a puzzle that could blow her carefully constructed reality to bits—all while pretending she’s not completely thrown by the mysterious man who makes her second-guess everything.</p> <p>For fans of smart-mouthed heroines, supernatural suspense, and mythology with a modern twist—<i>Oracle </i>is your next binge-worthy obsession.</p>"; 
